<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>

<paragraphs xml:id="par-dynamic-document" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
    <title>A Dynamic Document</title>

    <p>
      This is a work in progress, designed to evolve alongside author's own intellectual journey, as new insights are
      gained, "concept bridges" are strengthened, practice problems are expanded, and current understandings are
      refined and reinforced. My hope is that this system serves as a model for how technical knowledge can be organized,
      retained, and applied with precision, representing a humble attempt to preserve the clarity and reproducibility
      that serve as the lifeblood of science and engineering.
    </p>

    <note>
        <p>
          <strong>:ember:</strong> <em>There and Back Again</em> will be routinely updated over time.
        </p>

    </note>

</paragraphs>